  I0 --> RM["ref model: route(pkt) -> set of ports"]
  I9 --> RM
  RM --> EXP["expected[out_port][uid]"]
  O0 --> CMP["match by uid: legal port, data, dup, latency"]
  O19 --> CMP
  EXP --> CMP
```

